{"about_the_game":"Welcome to Tactical Zone, an exciting cooperative third-person shooter that will give you adrenaline and unforgettable moments on the battlefield! Gather a team of four players and enter the battle, where your cohesion and tactical skills will be the key to victory.<br><br>In Tactical Zone you will face endless waves of enemies on various maps. Your task is to hold out as long as possible, deflecting the onslaught of enemy forces. <br><br>Are you ready to take on the challenge and prove your skill on the battlefield? Join Tactical Zone and become a legend in the world of tactical shooters!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Tactical third-person battles.<br></li><li>Team gameplay and cooperative operations.<br></li><li>Endless waves.<br></li><li>Interesting maps and combat atmosphere.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DISCORD</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Join our Discord community to participate in game development, stay up to date with the latest news, and offer your ideas and help find bugs!<br></li></ul>.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"10 KILLS","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2501750/b75fbf6680b2ea2da42251422342f1b6f1a716d0.jpg"},{"name":"50 KILLS","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2501750/4355d2206634d15a968c27cc823511291b8cb828.jpg"},{"name":"100 KILLS","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2501750/6b149b72e0de761590ad704ec705a2ca856e7216.jpg"},{"name":"1000 KILLS","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2501750/8c73f3fadc34934c9328d2931c188e8a734c5670.jpg"},{"name":"1 SKILL","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2501750/a24f97466cb82c53fa23a42cddde324f61379e44.jpg"},{"name":"5 SKILLS","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2501750/6574e269d94